{"id":"entusiasmo","lemma":"entusiasmo","pos":"noun","rank":3397,"glosses":["enthusiasm"],"ipa":"/entuˈsjasmo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"entusiasmos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/02/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-entusiasmo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Acepté con entusiasmo.","en":"I enthusiastically accepted.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705529","words":[{"g":"to accept","l":"aceptar"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"El entusiasmo es contagioso.","en":"Enthusiasm is contagious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/554084","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"contagious"}]},{"text":"Él trabajó con más entusiasmo que nunca.","en":"He worked harder than ever.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/25310","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to work","l":"trabajar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"never"}]},{"text":"Ella tocaba el piano con entusiasmo.","en":"She played the piano with enthusiasm.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to touch","l":"tocar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"piano"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"No puedo decir que comparta tu entusiasmo por la idea.","en":"I can't say I share your enthusiasm for the idea.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to say"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to share","l":"compartir"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"idea"}]}]}